# Exceptions to scripts/check-comments.mjs, one per line:
#   <path prefix> :: <regular expression matched against the comment line> :: <reason>
packages/viewer/main/src/doors/snippet.ts :: @VERSION/ :: a URL placeholder the reader replaces with a version
cloudpdf/viewer/main/src/index.ts :: @VERSION/ :: a URL placeholder the reader replaces with a version
packages/core/signature/src :: signing-certificate-v2 :: the ESS attribute name (RFC 5035), not a version reference
packages/engine/ :: UUID v4|v4 UUID :: the RFC 4122 UUID version (random UUIDs), not a version reference
cloudpdf/sdk/src/core/ :: . :: Fern's own SDK runtime, rewritten by every api:sync: its words, not ours
cloudpdf/sdk/tests/unit/ :: . :: Fern's own tests of that runtime, rewritten by every api:sync
cloudpdf/website/src/ :: `/docs\.md` :: the public Markdown URL of the docs landing page, not a repository file
